TI  - Integrating GenAI in a Post-Licensure Pathophysiology Course to Enhance 
      Communication Skills and Promote AI Literacy.
LID - 10.1097/01.NEP.0000000000001549 [doi]
AB  - The rapid evolution of Generative Artificial Intelligence (AI) (GenAI) presents 
      new opportunities for enhancing nursing education. This innovation explores the 
      integration of GenAI into a post-licensure pathophysiology course, where students 
      use AI tools to develop patient education pamphlets. The initiative aimed to 
      improve comprehension of complex medical concepts, enhance communication skills, 
      and promote AI literacy. By critically evaluating AI-generated content, students 
      engaged in deeper learning while addressing ethical considerations surrounding AI 
      use. This pedagogical approach aligns with the increasing role of AI in health 
      care, preparing future nurses to effectively interact with AI-driven tools.
