TI  - A Maturity Model for REDCap-Based Patient-Facing Technologies: A Roadmap Toward 
      Patient-Centered Intelligence.
PG  - 1830-1834
LID - 10.3233/SHTI260554 [doi]
AB  - With the increasing adoption of patient-facing technologies (PFTs) that support 
      direct interaction and real-time health data capture, the Research Electronic 
      Data Capture (REDCap) ecosystem has emerged as a sustainable web-based 
      alternative to mobile operating system-dependent applications. However, 
      presenting raw health data without interpretation can burden patients, 
      particularly those with limited health literacy. To address this gap, we propose 
      a four-tier maturity model-Data Collection, System Integration, Personalized 
      Insights, and Intelligence Hub-that outlines an evolutionary pathway from 
      isolated data silos to AI-enabled, proactive patient support. By defining key 
      capabilities across tiers, the model provides a structured roadmap to guide the 
      design, implementation, and evaluation of sustainable REDCap-based PFTs that 
      enhance patient engagement and improve health outcomes.
