OAB - AI for patient consent and shared decision making We reviewed 18 studies 
      examining how generative artificial intelligence (GAI) can help doctors 
      explaining urological conditions and treatment options to patients. We found that 
      these GAI tools provide accurate information for common pathologies and can help 
      in saving consultation time. However, GAI should not be used alone for complex 
      scenarios, where urologists’ expertise remains essential for patient safety.
