FAU - DeCotiis, Gissoo
AU  - DeCotiis G
AD  - Global Medical Affairs - Oncology, Formerly of Daiichi Sankyo, Basking Ridge, NJ, 
      USA.
FAU - Singhi, Eric K
AU  - Singhi EK
AD  - Department of Thoracic/Head and Neck Medical Oncology, University of Texas MD 
      Anderson Cancer Center, Houston, TX, USA.
LA  - eng
