TI  - Standards-Aligned Integration of Artificial Intelligence and Simulation in 
      Nursing Professional Development for Novice Nurse Readiness.
LID - 10.1097/NND.0000000000001228 [doi]
AB  - As artificial intelligence (AI) reshapes health care delivery, nursing 
      professional development (NPD) educators must develop digital readiness in novice 
      nurses. Recent accreditation trends for transition-to-practice programs have 
      formalized curriculum design, supporting an evidence-based approach to 
      integrating digital competencies through simulation-based education (SBE). 
      AI-enhanced ethical case studies and reflective debriefings promote digital 
      literacy and clinical reasoning, advancing SBE as a strategy for promoting 
      practice readiness.
