VI  - 327
DP  - 2025 May 15
TI  - Improving the Readability of Dementia Information Documents Using ChatGPT.
PG  - 880-881
LID - 10.3233/SHTI250489 [doi]
AB  - There is much information available on dementia, but information may not be 
      written at an appropriate level for a lay reader. One aim of the CoDESIGN project 
      is to simplify information available for those who have lower levels of literacy. 
      We investigate the potential to simplify documents to reflect the literacy 
      abilities of the reader. We report on the ability of ChatGPT to modify documents 
      to such target reading levels while retaining the accuracy and completeness of 
      the documents, while avoiding the introduction of errors. Results suggest that 
      human supervision is required before documents can be made available to readers.
