TI  - Constructing Patient Resources Keeping Literacy and Readability in Mind.
PG  - 89-101
LID - 10.1080/02763869.2025.2470521 [doi]
AB  - Librarians build health literacy, beginning with a focus on literacy and 
      information literacy and moving to health literacy for different age and ethnic 
      groups, and levels of literacy groups. Today with media, librarians have concern 
      for the method of how to build literacy. They apply a readability formula to 
      assess health information in multi-languages and different formats to assure each 
      constituency can build their literacy level. This article presents definitions of 
      the many types of literacy, readability formulas, literacy assessment tools and 
      readability apps. The generative AI tool perplexity designed original properly 
      targeted health information.
