      Schlett, Fabian Thomczyk, Sebastian Voigt-Radloff, Constanze Wegner, Katharina 
      Wollmann, Andy Maun. Originally published in JMIR Human Factors 
      (https://humanfactors.jmir.org), 23.01.2025.
