TI  - Artificial Intelligence: Its future in the health sector and its role for medical 
      education.
PG  - 2014099
LID - 10.1080/21614083.2021.2014099 [doi]
LID - 2014099
AB  - The - possibly - imminent AI revolution will, to a great extent, affect the 
      education and training for all knowledge-working professions, and therefore must 
      be considered an important aspect also of CME. This paper reviews some of the 
      misconceptions about AI technology, then turns to point out possible applications 
      of AI in the medical domain and then addresses the question what this will mean 
      for (continuing) medical education.
