      Galivanche, Murugesan Periyasamy, M Chiranjeevi, Amit Subhash Khandewale, Geetha 
      Ramachandran, Daksha Shah, Jessica E Haberer, Kenneth H Mayer, Ramnath 
      Subbaraman. Originally published in JMIR mHealth and uHealth 
      (http://mhealth.jmir.org), 31.07.2020.
